WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.667 --> 00:00:13.174
"The guards are coming!" the servant repeated.

2
00:00:13.175 --> 00:00:16.663
"Uh-oh," said Vinnie.

3
00:00:16.664 --> 00:00:22.568
"Someone must have seen us sneak into the palace," cried Mandy.

4
00:00:22.569 --> 00:00:25.152
Gildong's face was pale.

5
00:00:25.153 --> 00:00:29.222
"We will go to jail if they find us here," he said.

6
00:00:29.223 --> 00:00:31.466
The princess stood.

7
00:00:31.467 --> 00:00:35.358
"Don't worry! I have a plan," she said.

8
00:00:35.359 --> 00:00:38.015
"I will hide you in my palanquin.

9
00:00:38.016 --> 00:00:41.610
Then my servants will carry you out of the palace."

10
00:00:41.611 --> 00:00:44.507
"Prepare my palanquin at the backdoor!"

11
00:00:44.508 --> 00:00:47.019
the princess ordered a servant.

12
00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:52.313
"Yes, Your Highness," the servant replied and then hurried off.

13
00:00:52.314 --> 00:00:56.667
Soon the children were following the princess.

14
00:00:56.668 --> 00:01:00.013
Mandy stopped when she heard something.

15
00:01:00.014 --> 00:01:03.337
"Is that a guitar?" she asked.

16
00:01:03.338 --> 00:01:05.901
Gildong stopped too.

17
00:01:05.902 --> 00:01:10.492
"I think it's a string instrument, a geomungo," he said.

18
00:01:10.493 --> 00:01:12.854
"Only rich people play it."

19
00:01:12.855 --> 00:01:17.566
"Come on!" The princess waved for them to catch up.

20
00:01:17.567 --> 00:01:21.047
Then she led them to a small courtyard.

21
00:01:21.048 --> 00:01:26.561
Four servants stood waiting there beside a beautiful palanquin.

22
00:01:26.562 --> 00:01:31.119
"They will carry you outside the palace," said the princess.

23
00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:33.677
"So I must say good-bye now."

24
00:01:33.678 --> 00:01:39.020
"Good-bye," said Mandy. "And thank you!"

25
00:01:39.021 --> 00:01:42.420
Vinnie and Gildong said thanks too.

26
00:01:42.421 --> 00:01:46.140
Then the three of them ducked into the palanquin.

27
00:01:46.141 --> 00:01:51.043
A moment later Mandy felt the palanquin start to move.

28
00:01:51.044 --> 00:01:54.288
"We're off!" she thought.

29
00:01:54.289 --> 00:01:58.433
Then Vinnie nudged her and showed her the photo.

30
00:01:58.434 --> 00:02:03.034
"Mandy, the photo is glowing blue!" he whispered.

31
00:02:03.035 --> 00:02:08.665
"But where are the three gates?" she whispered back.

32
00:02:08.666 --> 00:02:11.639
Soon the palanquin stopped.

33
00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:16.712
When they climbed out, they saw they were outside the palace gates.

34
00:02:16.713 --> 00:02:21.335
The four men bowed and went back to the palace.

35
00:02:21.336 --> 00:02:25.630
"I must go home to do my chores," Gildong said.

36
00:02:25.631 --> 00:02:27.279
"Good-bye!"

37
00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:29.212
"Thank you for everything!"

38
00:02:29.213 --> 00:02:32.676
said Vinnie, waving to their new friend.

39
00:02:32.677 --> 00:02:35.704
"Good-bye!" Mandy added.

40
00:02:35.705 --> 00:02:38.803
She turned and grabbed Vinnie's arm.

41
00:02:38.804 --> 00:02:42.869
"Come on! Let's see if these are the right gates."

42
00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:46.458
But Vinnie already knew that they were.

43
00:02:46.459 --> 00:02:48.687
He looked at the photo.

44
00:02:48.688 --> 00:02:52.596
It was glowing red.

45
00:02:52.597 --> 00:02:55.773
"We're going home!" he whispered.

46
00:02:55.774 --> 00:02:59.303
The children fell into the tunnel.

47
00:02:59.304 --> 00:03:04.060
When they opened their eyes again, they were back in the attic.

48
00:03:04.061 --> 00:03:08.159
Mandy put the photo back inside the album.

49
00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:14.070
"That palanquin ride reminded me of our Japan trip," she said.

50
00:03:14.071 --> 00:03:17.284
"Yes," Vinnie said, nodding.

51
00:03:17.285 --> 00:03:23.484
"There's only one more page in the album," she said slowly.

52
00:03:23.485 --> 00:03:26.609
"I know," he answered.

53
00:03:26.610 --> 00:03:32.502
"That means there's just one more photo trip left," Mandy added.

54
00:03:32.503 --> 00:03:35.351
Vinnie didn't say anything.

55
00:03:35.352 --> 00:03:37.221
He just nodded.

56
00:03:37.222 --> 00:03:43.792
Then he turned away to hide the sad look on his face.
